📁 Quick Paths:
   nyra     → /opt/nyra
   repos    → /opt/nyra/repos
   logs     → /opt/nyra/logs

🔧 Services:
   nyra-start   → Start all services
   nyra-stop    → Stop all services
   nyra-status  → Check service health
   nyra-logs    → View aggregated logs

🐳 Docker:
   dc up -d     → Start containers
   dc down      → Stop containers
   dclogs       → View logs

⚡ Claude Flow:
   cf-init      → Initialize swarm
   sparc-tdd    → Run TDD workflow

📚 Docs: /opt/nyra/docs/README.md
